        "created_at": "2016-02-09T06:12:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was just looking at this card tonight and had a weird thought. A card is in play during its destruction effects - we know this from Explosives Wagon, for example. If Focusing Conduit-Blade is destroyed (regardless of whether it was because you used the power or not), you can play another equipment card. Since Focusing Conduit-Blade is still in play and Limited, does that mean that you can't play another copy of Focusing Conduit-Blade, even though this one is on its way out?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
